    LLM: "Announcer calls an ace (suit and rank); that suit's ace holder is partner. Hearts are trump in calling games. Follow suit; when the called suit is led, holder must play the called ace if able (Unten Raus). Solo variants: declarer plays alone. Standard Schafkopf trick and point scoring.",
    Player: "Announcer calls an ace (suit and rank); that suit's ace holder is partner. Hearts are trump in calling games. Follow suit; when the called suit is led, holder must play the called ace if able (Unten Raus). Solo variants: declarer plays alone. Standard Schafkopf trick and point scoring.",
